// `emit_classify.vl` — the emitter's TYPE CLASSIFIERS and their supporting
// state: the `expr*`/`let*`/`declared*`/`param*`/`fnRet*`/`global*` families
// that resolve what VL type/rep a binding or expression lowers as, the
// narrowing and scope-slot bookkeeping they consult, and the shape/ref-list/
// literal-atom interning primitives they intern into on first sight. Reads the
// AST arena (`ast.vl`) and the shared emitter state (`emit_state.vl`); writes
// no bytes. Carved out of `wasmEmit.vl` (review N18).

// ── The type-name GRAMMAR, asked of its HOME (D-TYNAMEHOME phase 1a) ─────────────────
//
// TWENTY-TWO pure character grammars over a type-name STRING — **the count is DERIVED from
// the import below, not carried forward.** The "Eleven" it replaces was phase 1a's number
// and every later routing slice (W1/W2/W4/W7/W14, and this slice's `splitUnionAtoms` /
// `unionMemberCount` re-point off `./typecheck`) added to the list without touching the
// prose above it. Their one home is
// `compiler/tyname.vl`, a LEAF with zero imports (D-TYNAMEHOME phase 0) — so this file
// asks it DIRECTLY. Before phase 1a ELEVEN of them arrived by republication: ten
// through `emit_base.vl` (which republished what `typecheck.vl` republished from
// `tyname.vl` — three hops) and `nameIsFuncTypeAtom` through `typecheck.vl` (two); the two
// SPLIT grammars came the same two-hop way, through `typecheck.vl`, until this slice. The
// call sites did not change and could not tell the difference; what changes is that a
// reader who greps for a grammar's home lands on it in one hop.
//
// NOT here, deliberately: `isTopLevelFuncTypeName` (imported from `typecheck.vl` below)
// is a string predicate that also WRITES the module-level `funcArrowAt` bank two of its
// call sites read right after it returns — a body that reaches module state is not a
// leaf, so it stayed. `nameIsShapeSpanEnds` / `mapValNameOf` (from `emit_base.vl` below)
// are LAYERS on these grammars, not copies of them — a genuinely different SPAN rule
// (D-MAPOPENDOWN measured it) built on top, so `emit_base.vl` is their home.
